WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Sit in Staff Pose with both legs extended.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Cross the right foot over the left thigh near the knee.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Inhale to lengthen, then twist left and fold over the extended leg.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Hold the left foot with the right hand; left hand grounds beside the hip.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Breathe steadily, then unwind and switch sides.
